## Overview

Explore one of the largest open-source collections of shadcn dashboard kits, UI blocks, and components for React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript, and Supabase. Build production-ready admin panels faster with copy-paste components or install via the shadcn CLI.

## Features

- **Free-to-Use Template** – Access complete, production-ready admin layouts for commercial and personal use without cost.
- **Admin-Specific Focus** – This entire **collection of resources** is centered around components, blocks, and templates commonly used in dashboard admin interfaces.
- **React/Next.js Based** – Resources are optimized for modern React and Next.js applications.
- **Supabase Boilerplate** – Launch your SaaS faster with our production-ready Next.js and Supabase starter kit. Includes Supabase Auth, Prisma ORM, Postgres, and RBAC built on shadcn/ui.
- ** Ready-to-use prompts** – For dashboards, auth, forms, tables, and charts. Clean, type-safe code every time.
